<title>BRAZIL: TABLE-Copene H1 net 35.9 mln reais.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Copene H1 net 35.9 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian petrochemical firm Companhia Petroquimica do Nordeste (Copene) released the following first-half 1997 financial results.</p>
<p>		    Jan-June 1997	   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p> Net		  35.89 million	   N/A</p>
<p> Net Revs	  722.7 million	    N/A</p>
<p> Gross Profit    133.34 million	   N/A</p>
<p> Oper Profit	68.44 million	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
